+`reasoning_output_tokens`, `quality_score`, and `quality_score_blinded`. Token fields
+must be non-negative numbers. Cached input tokens are a subset of `input_tokens`, while
+reasoning output tokens are reported separately. Total tokens are always exactly
+`input_tokens + output_tokens`; neither cached input nor reasoning output tokens are
+added again. `quality_score` is a 0–100 number and requires the boolean
